      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEYOND EASY (3) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (23.28) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Shepparton. Will find this more suitable and can atone. PAW DULCE (1) steps out for the first time at this track. In the money last start when second (23.16) at Geelong over 400m. Well-placed to take this out. TRENTON'S ACE (4) is still a maiden after 18 runs but rarely out of the placings, the latest filling a minor again when third at this track. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Overdue and expected to feature again. KAELIX LASS (8) comes back from a spell as a top three prospect.",
